  45:../../../libDaisy/src/hid/midi.h ****          *           use MIDI with multiple UART peripherals, you must provide your own
  46:../../../libDaisy/src/hid/midi.h ****          *           buffer, allocated to a DMA-capable memory section.
  47:../../../libDaisy/src/hid/midi.h ****          */
